# Acceptance Criteria — Template (Domain-Agnostic)

## Resource CRUD
- Given valid resource data
- When POST /api/app/resource
- Then the resource is created with default state

## Approve Resource
- Given resource in Pending
- When POST /api/app/resource/{id}/approve
- Then state=Approved

## Listing & Filters
- Given filters
- When GET /api/app/resource?filter=...
- Then returns items matching filters
